--   Round-six lemma `MS_of`
-- statement:
--   `S ≥ (1 - 1/(4d)) T`-type bound: `2 M ≤ S`.
--
--   The following holds (Lean statement, in the scope of module `Solutions.R6MFacts`):
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem IntMul.Kappa.R6.MS_of (P : Prm) (n : ℕ) (src : ℕ → ℕ) (hs : SrcOK6 P n src) (hd : 1 ≤ dP6 P n)
--       (hl : 1 ≤ ℓP6 P n) (hL : 3 ≤ LP6 P n) (hb : 1 ≤ b'P6 P n) :
--       2 * M6 P n ≤ S6 P n src
--   ```
--
--   **Context.** Round-six machine: `QOk` for large `n`
--
--   * `prod_tF6`: `∏_{j<d} t_j = T`.
--   * `eps_room`: eventually `4 b^ε ≤ b` (so `ℓ ≥ 2`).
--   * **`qok_of`**: for `P.Ok`, there is `n₁` such that `QOk ⟨P, n, src⟩` holds for every `n ≥ n₁` and
--     every source list with `SrcOK6 P n src`.
